  ('Seated Dumbbell Hip Flexion', 'seated_dumbbell_hip_flexion__catalog_440', 'Sitting tall on the edge of a bench, a dumbbell placed across the lower thigh just above the knee and steadied with the hand. Lift the knee as high as you can without leaning back, then lower.', 'Dumbbells', 'Hip flexion', 'unilateral', 440, 'Barbell & Lower Body — Expansion v1', 'Hips & glutes', 'LocalForgeWeb/Sports-genome', 'client/src/lib/exerciseCatalogAdditions.ts'),
  ('Suitcase Carry', 'suitcase_carry__catalog_441', 'One dumbbell in one hand at the side, walk tall without leaning toward or away from it. Switch hands and walk the same distance.', 'Dumbbells', 'Loaded carry', 'unilateral', 441, 'Carries, Sleds & Trunk — Expansion v1', 'Conditioning', 'LocalForgeWeb/Sports-genome', 'client/src/lib/exerciseCatalogAdditions.ts'),
  ('Front-Rack Kettlebell Carry', 'front_rack_kettlebell_carry__catalog_442', 'Two kettlebells held in the front rack (bells resting on the forearms, hands at the chest), walk tall. This record is the two-bell carry; a single-bell front-rack carry is a different, offset exercise.', 'Kettlebell', 'Loaded carry', 'bilateral', 442, 'Carries, Sleds & Trunk — Expansion v1', 'Conditioning', 'LocalForgeWeb/Sports-genome', 'client/src/lib/exerciseCatalogAdditions.ts'),
  ('Single-Arm Kettlebell Overhead Carry', 'single_arm_kettlebell_overhead_carry__catalog_443', 'One kettlebell locked out overhead, arm straight and biceps by the ear, walk tall. Switch arms and walk the same distance.', 'Kettlebell', 'Loaded carry', 'unilateral', 443, 'Carries, Sleds & Trunk — Expansion v1', 'Conditioning', 'LocalForgeWeb/Sports-genome', 'client/src/lib/exerciseCatalogAdditions.ts'),
  ('Sandbag Bear-Hug Carry', 'sandbag_bear_hug_carry__catalog_444', 'A sandbag hugged to the chest with the arms wrapped around it, walk upright.', 'Sandbag', 'Loaded carry', 'bilateral', 444, 'Carries, Sleds & Trunk — Expansion v1', 'Conditioning', 'LocalForgeWeb/Sports-genome', 'client/src/lib/exerciseCatalogAdditions.ts'),
  ('Sandbag Ground-to-Shoulder', 'sandbag_ground_to_shoulder__catalog_445', 'Sandbag on the floor between the feet. Hinge, grab it, lap it if needed, then drive the hips through to pop it onto one shoulder; stand tall, return it to the floor, and alternate shoulders. A rep counts when you stand tall with it on the shoulder.', 'Sandbag', 'Explosive hinge', 'alternating', 445, 'Carries, Sleds & Trunk — Expansion v1', 'Power & athletic', 'LocalForgeWeb/Sports-genome', 'client/src/lib/exerciseCatalogAdditions.ts'),
  ('Backward Overhead Sled Drag', 'backward_overhead_sled_drag__catalog_446', 'Face the sled holding the strap handles directly overhead with the elbows straight, and walk backward keeping the arms up the whole way (the Free Exercise DB''s ''Sled Overhead Backward Walk'').', 'Sled', 'Resisted locomotion / drag', 'bilateral', 446, 'Carries, Sleds & Trunk — Expansion v1', 'Conditioning', 'LocalForgeWeb/Sports-genome', 'client/src/lib/exerciseCatalogAdditions.ts'),
  ('Sled Rope Pull', 'sled_rope_pull__catalog_447', 'Standing still in an athletic stance with a rope tied to the sled, pull the sled toward you hand over hand until it arrives.', 'Sled', 'Horizontal pull', 'bilateral', 447, 'Carries, Sleds & Trunk — Expansion v1', 'Conditioning', 'LocalForgeWeb/Sports-genome', 'client/src/lib/exerciseCatalogAdditions.ts'),
  ('Cable Side Bend', 'cable_side_bend__catalog_448', 'Standing side-on to a low pulley, handle in the near hand. Let the cable pull you into a side bend toward it, then bend away from the stack to upright and slightly past.', 'Cable', 'Lateral flexion', 'unilateral', 448, 'Carries, Sleds & Trunk — Expansion v1', 'Core', 'LocalForgeWeb/Sports-genome', 'client/src/lib/exerciseCatalogAdditions.ts'),
  ('Dumbbell Side Bend', 'dumbbell_side_bend__catalog_449', 'Standing with one dumbbell in one hand and the other hand on the hip. Bend sideways away from the dumbbell as far as you can, return through upright and let it lower toward the dumbbell side; finish the reps, then switch hands. The side opposite the dumbbell does the lifting.', 'Dumbbells', 'Lateral flexion', 'unilateral', 449, 'Carries, Sleds & Trunk — Expansion v1', 'Core', 'LocalForgeWeb/Sports-genome', 'client/src/lib/exerciseCatalogAdditions.ts'),
  ('Half-Kneeling Cable Lift', 'half_kneeling_cable_lift__catalog_450', 'Half-kneeling side-on to a low pulley with a rope or bar, the inside knee down. Pull the handle across the body and press it up and away (low to high), keeping the trunk from turning, then return.', 'Cable', 'Anti-rotation', 'unilateral', 450, 'Carries, Sleds & Trunk — Expansion v1', 'Core', 'LocalForgeWeb/Sports-genome', 'client/src/lib/exerciseCatalogAdditions.ts')
